TEXT 72 -160 Left 2 ;SIM 4b - IF chain + limiter (rev 3)
TEXT 72 -128 Left 2 ;Tests: does the output stop following the input?
TEXT 72 -96 Left 2 ;Result: +20 dB in gives +1.6 dB out, 2.51 Vpp delivered, limiting from about 22 uV.
TEXT 72 -64 Left 2 ;Explained in fm_receiver/DESIGN_LOG.md, section 'SIM 4 - the IF amplifier and limiter'. Old sheet notes: fm_receiver/sim_notes.md.
